WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.436
Formula One is basically
my life, my world.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:07.207 position:56%
I like to battle against the world's
fastest 19 other drivers.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:09.609
No other thing makes me
happier than driving.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.817 position:58%
When Formula One held its
first Chinese Grand Prix in Shanghai,

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:20.420
five-year-old Zhou
Guanyu was in the stands

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.889 position:58%
cheering on his idol Fernando Alonso.

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:25.925 position:58%
Now, Zhou is competing against Alonso

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:30.563
after he became China's first
full-time F1 racer last year.

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:35.468
I really started to fall in love
with racing my first ever attempt

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.772
or try when I was a kid
around seven years old.

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:41.141
We went to an indoor go-kart track

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.809
and I was actually very scared.

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:45.545 position:61%
I was sitting in the two seater go-kart

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.679
my dad was driving.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.281 position:56%
But then, the first time I tried it,

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.949 position:63%
I absolutely fell in love with the sport

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.486
and I really want to do it
every weekend after school.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:56.456 position:59%
As a kid, I grew up having that dream.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:59.426
The most challenging part
for me in Formula One is

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.094
is probably before the first race.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:04.564 position:61%
A lot of people were doubtful about me,
saying I won't be fast, I'll be last.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.166 position:59%
But for me, I was just really focused.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:07.934
I knew I deserved to be there.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:12.806
And to get my first points
in my first season is amazing.

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:15.775 position:58%
Zhou is a very, very talented driver.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:19.112
We have been following
him from the junior category.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.580
We were fully convinced that

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.051
he can be a very strong
addition to our team,

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:28.254
and he confirmed our
expectation last year.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.924 position:61%
Imagine a rookie, coming to Formula One

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:33.026
and being able to score points

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:34.227
at the very first race.

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.963 position:63%
To have a Chinese driver of such a level

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:39.466 position:56%
is beneficial not only for our team,

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:43.036
but for the entire Formula One.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:56.382 position:58%
But that hasn't translated into
comparable dollars for the franchise.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.518 position:64%
The cancelation of the Chinese Grand Prix

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:00.653
for a fourth straight year in 2023

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.388
has been another setback.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.057
But Zhou's emergence

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:06.292 position:66%
might be the key to turning things around.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.161
Now in his second season,

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.662
Zhou has already attracted

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:12.298 position:58%
sponsorship deals from global brands.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:15.602 position:64%
Any international sports coming to China,

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:19.372
for it to truly become popular,
it needs to have relevance.

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:21.174
And nothing builds relevance

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:25.778
like having your own superstar
and champion to support.

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.547
We've seen that in other sports,

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.983
basketball, with the
emergence of Yao Ming,

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:31.317
tennis and Li Na,

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.520 position:64%
how those superstars on the global stage,

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.688
have really boosted the sport.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:38.691
Now we have Zhou Guanyu
on the grid of Formula One,

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.794
that will also stimulate
commercial interest.

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:45.732
Hopefully, when Formula One
comes back to China next year,

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:49.903 position:63%
it will start to really reap the rewards
and grow the popularity.

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:53.506
For me to be the first Chinese
or the only Chinese in F1,

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:57.010
I definitely see what's
happened back home.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.579
It's been quite incredible
seeing how many people

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:01.981
that are staying up late
to watch the Grand Prix.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:05.518
And now all we need is a Grand Prix
in front of the home crowd.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.420
because there's so many new fans

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.789
who doesn't know anything
about motorsports

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.324
now actually getting into that.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:15.028 position:56%
Watching or trying to understand F1.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:17.830
Traditionally, it costs
quite a lot of money

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.267 position:58%
to develop a driver from a young age.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:23.836 position:56%
An increasingly wealthy middle class

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:26.139 position:64%
will mean you'll have a growing community

00:03:26.139 --> 00:03:28.341 position:66%
that will be interested in their children,

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:31.077 position:58%
perhaps becoming Formula One drivers.

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:33.379 position:61%
There will be many, many Chinese people

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:36.316
competing in motorsport and
Formula One in the future.

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:39.819
I'm only optimistic that things
can get better from here.

